  cardText: "(stand-in until Grandma's own card is added)\n\nDill Pickle Chips\n\nFor each pint:\nA head of dill and {garlic} cloves of garlic\nChips packed in snug, right to the shoulder (about {slices})\n\nBrine: water to the first line in the pot, vinegar to the top line, {salt} scoops of salt. Bring it to a rolling boil.\n\nPour the hot brine up to the line on the jar. Lids on, {minutes} minutes in the water bath.\n\nThe canner takes four pints at a time."
